# React & UI

## Shell

- Primary surface is the calendar (`PharmacyCalendar`). Keep the viewport calendar-first.
- App chrome is a single top bar: logo + name left; icon-only actions right.
- Put People, Security, Notifications, Create, Search in modals via `Modal` — not new full-page nav clutter.

## Components

- Functional components only; colocate feature code under `src/features/<name>/`
- Use existing CSS variables from `src/index.css` (`--color-*`, `--event-*`, `--radius-*`)
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Forms: React Hook Form + Zod (`src/lib/validation.ts` patterns)
- Server/async state: TanStack Query. Do not introduce Redux or new UI libraries.

## Calendar

- FullCalendar plugins already in use (daygrid, timegrid, list, multimonth, interaction)
- Event kinds: `shift` | `note` | `task` with matching `.event-*` classes
- Preserve mobile usability (dvh shell, touch-friendly icon targets)

## Don't

- Add Tailwind, CSS-in-JS, or card-heavy dashboards in the main app shell
- Route secondary tools as permanent side panels competing with the calendar
